Apache-2.0, buddi's own license, is this template's default: `buddi plugins init`
writes it unless --license names another. Change "license" in package.json and
this file together if you want a different one.

Replace this placeholder with the full text of the license before you publish
(for Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt), and put your
name and the year here:

Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]
